description: "The 2026.10.4 full audit reported four high dev-only findings through pm-ops -> fast-glob -> micromatch -> braces; production audit was clean. PR #141 replaced that chain by adopting published canonical pm-ops tooling and removing fast-glob, preserving the duplication and coverage thresholds. The earlier contingency about waiting for a patched braces package is superseded by the delivered dependency replacement."
