actual_result: "Main 80717afb81f1 contains PR #141 delivery afd01629ede3. Its package-lock.json resolves PM CLI 2026.10.15 and pm-ops 2026.10.16 and contains no fast-glob, micromatch or braces package entries. Linked remediation item pm-gantt-chart-maint1014 records full audit 0, production audit 0, npm ls braces empty, npm and Bun each passing 244/244 tests and both full release gates passing at unchanged thresholds. Fresh review npm ci and full/production npm audits each report zero vulnerabilities. These dependency receipts do not establish the separate dated 2026.10.4 certification."
